spans.s:
cl. 1. P. Ā. ˚कति, ˚कते, to be satiated or contented or satisfied, Dhātup. iv, 19;
to repel, resist, ib.;
to shine, xix, 21 (cf. √ कन् and कम्.)

aचक्ष् (a reduplicated form of √ काश् = क्शा; in the non-conjugational tenses √ ख्या is substituted, Pāṇ. ii, 4, 54 f.; some pf. forms, however, are found) cl. 2. Ā. च॑ष्टे (2. du. चक्षाथे, RV.; pf. p. च॑क्षाण, RV.; BhP. i, 18, 25 [अ- neg.]; rarely P. impf. 2. sg. अचक्षस्, MBh. viii, 3384, 1. pl. अचक्ष्म, Naigh. iii, 11; Ved. inf. च॑क्षसे, RV.; AV. vi, 68, 2),
to appear, become visible, RV. viii, 19, 16; x, 74, 2 and 92, 6 ;
to see, look at, observe, notice, RV.; BhP.;
to tell, inform, MBh. viii, 3384;
to take any one (acc.) for (acc.), BhP. x, 73, 11.
